ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250303162655_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250303162655_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/match1730646date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">遭绝平！皇马1-1贝蒂斯距榜首8分 安东尼造绝平维尼修斯破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1730646_1777065041_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1730646_1777065041_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1730646_1777065041_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>维尼修斯破门，贝莱林读秒绝平。最终皇马1-1贝蒂斯，皇马74分先赛落后榜首8分，贝蒂斯50分第五。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69ebdae49d878native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">西甲积分榜：皇马先赛剩5轮距巴萨8分，巴萨今晚将客战赫塔费</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/match1713717date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">领先降级区8分！森林5-0客胜桑德兰 吉布斯-怀特传射休姆乌龙</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.66" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1713717_1777064060_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.66" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.66" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1713717_1777064060_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1713717_1777064060_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>吉布斯·怀特传射，伊戈尔·热苏斯破门，桑德兰0-5诺丁汉森林。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/match1711037date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">先赛暂第二！那不勒斯4-0克雷莫内塞 德布劳内传射麦克托米奈建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.69" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1711037_1777061939_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.69" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.69" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1711037_1777061939_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260425/zhanbao_image_1711037_1777061939_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>德布劳内传射，麦克托米奈建功，那不勒斯4-0大胜克雷莫内塞，本轮先赛情况下，那不勒斯暂升至积分榜第二。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69ebdf3a612b8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">皇马电台怒批：巴萨发挥糟糕能轻松获点，皇马100%点球却被漏判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.29" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250523516393.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.29" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.29" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250523516393.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250523516393.jpg"> </div><p>皇马1-1遭贝蒂斯绝平，皇马电台对判罚表达了不满。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69ebdf6588ad3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿韦洛亚：很多裁判根本不懂足球，我们早已遭遇多次不公判罚</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.09" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250533316556.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.09" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.09" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250533316556_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250533316556_720.jpg"> </div><p>皇马客场1-1遭贝蒂斯绝平，R罗的一次禁区内手球引起判罚争议，阿韦洛亚也在赛后第一时间向媒体控诉。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69eb879c25724native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here we go！罗马诺：多特前主帅泰尔齐奇执教毕巴，接替巴尔韦德</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604242309294094_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604242309294094_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260424/202604242309294094_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“here we go”宣布，多特前主帅泰尔齐奇将执教毕尔巴鄂竞技，接替巴尔韦德，双方将签约2年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-24/69eb8e7368f2enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">兰帕德：切尔西是我生命中最重要一部分，但应对困境是他们的事务</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.44" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260404/69d08e284fda4.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.44" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.44" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260404/69d08e284fda4.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260404/69d08e284fda4.jpg"> </div><p>兰帕德成为切尔西新帅候选，对于这样的传闻，兰帕德发表了自己的观点。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69eb96dd52f72native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">意大利足球改革草案初稿：投资青训 佣金封顶 意甲意乙缩减至18队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.77" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260425/202604250030367962.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.77" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.77" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260425/202604250030367962.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260425/202604250030367962.jpg"> </div><p>意大利足球改革首份法案初稿流出，《意大利天空体育》对细节进行了披露和整理。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69eb9ee0daa79native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿斯：除了巴萨外，B席经纪人还主动联系了皇马但后者无意引进</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240510/663e0a5ce38b6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240510/663e0a5ce38b6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_240510/663e0a5ce38b6.jpg"> </div><p>《阿斯报》消息，经纪人豪尔赫·门德斯将B席推荐给了皇马，但目前他并不在皇马的计划之内。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69eba42a182f7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">隆戈：曼联初步问询莱奥的转会情况 米兰要价预计至少6000万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg"> </div><p>名记隆戈透露，曼联已经就拉斐尔·莱奥进行了初步问询，米兰方面预计要价至少6000万欧元。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69ebaa1fe268dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：西布朗财务违规，将被立即扣除2个积分</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.74" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_171120/5a12dd360fe1a.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.74" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.74" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_171120/5a12dd360fe1a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_171120/5a12dd360fe1a.jpg"> </div><p>西布朗官方消息，俱乐部将被扣2分。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69ebaab1ea418native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TNT：阿尔瓦雷斯家人在巴塞罗那找房，球员可能加盟巴萨</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250139177783.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250139177783_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260425/202604250139177783_720.jpg"> </div><p>据TNT消息，阿尔瓦雷斯的家人正在巴塞罗那找房，球员可能很快成为巴萨一员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69eba8b75b86cnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">隆戈：巴萨向莱万送上1年续约合同 米兰关注DV9并几乎敲定磁卡</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251217/6941e2b41eea0_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251217/6941e2b41eea0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251217/6941e2b41eea0.jpg"> </div><p>名记隆戈谈尤文图斯和AC米兰的转会传闻，透露巴萨已经向莱万送上了一年续约合同，米兰仍在关注弗拉霍维奇并且几乎敲定免签格雷茨卡。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69ebb78cba118native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：国米将1500万欧买断阿坎吉 利物浦仍对邓弗里斯感兴趣</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251007/68e4b93f9233e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251007/68e4b93f9233e.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251007/68e4b93f9233e.jpg"> </div><p>在新一期的播客节目中，名记罗马诺谈论了国米的转会运作以及邓弗里斯的未来问题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-04-25/69ebead1a971dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">图片报：桑乔在曼联年薪1600万欧，若回归多特需大幅降薪至600万</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251128/6929050ec4ecf.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251128/6929050ec4ecf.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251128/6929050ec4ecf.jpg"> </div><p>《图片报》报道，若桑乔想加盟多特，降薪将是关键。</p><script> 	$(function(){ 	    $(".video-bg").find('span').click(function(){/*视频播放*/             var _this = this;             var index = $(".video-bg span").index(this);             var MediaArr = document.getElementsByTagName("video");             $(this).parent().hide();             MediaArr[index].play();             MediaArr[index].controls = true;             $(".video-box").each(function(i, item) {                 if ($(this).find('span').get(0) !== _this) {                     $(this).find('.video-bg').show();                     MediaArr[i].pause();                     MediaArr[i].controls = false;                 }             })         });  	if(typeof(canLoadImage)=='function'){/*新版图片打开方式定义*/ 		if(!((typeof(getNetType)==='function' && getNetType()) || canLoadImage())){             $(".img_wrap").css('background-color', '#D9D9DA').find('.play_btn').css('text-indent','0');         } 		var platform = $('input[name="platform"]').val(); 		platform = platform=='ios'?'ios':'android'; 		var img_op = img_op_value = ''; 		function show_small_gif1(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 				img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 				var lineHeight = $(this).find('.play_btn').height();  				if((img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4||img_op_value==7)&&$(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){ 				    $(this).css('background-image',"url('"+$(this).attr("data-thumb")+"')"); 				    $(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('line-height', lineHeight + 'px').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}  		setTimeout(show_small_gif1(),100); 		/*load_type 1=wifi,2=4G&&loadimg,3=4G&&noloadimg*/ 		function load_img(this_obj,load_type,status) { 			img_op = get_img_op_attr(this_obj,platform); 			img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 			/*var img = this_obj.children('img:first');*/ 			var img = this_obj.find('img:eq(0)'); 			if(load_type==1){ 				if(img_op_value==1 || img_op_value==7){ 					if(img.attr('t-rc')==img.attr('src')){ 						open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 					}else{ 						this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 						img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 					} 				}else if(status==1){ 					open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 				} 			}else if(load_type==2&&this_obj.attr('type')=='IMG'){ 				this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 				img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 			} 			if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){                 img.load(function(){                     window.webkit.messageHandlers.imageLoaded.postMessage('test');                 }); 			}else if(platform=='ios'&&typeof(imageLoaded)=='function'){ 				img.load(function(){ 				    /*加载完成*/                     imageLoaded(); 				}); 			} 		}; 		 		var ms = 1000; 		if(platform === 'android'){ 		    ms = 10; 		} 		setTimeout(function(){ 			if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){/*wifi*/ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				load_img($(this),1,0) 				}); 			}else{ 				if(canLoadImage()){/*载入图片*/ 					$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 						load_img($(this),2,0) 					}); 			}else{ 				$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 					load_img($(this),3,0); 				}); 			} 			} 		}, ms);  		$(".img_wrap").click( 				function(){ 				    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url');                     if(jumpUrl){                         return openLink(jumpUrl);                     } 					load_img($(this),1,1); 					event.stopPropagation(); 				} 			); 		$('a').click(function(e){ 			img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 			img_op_value = parseInt(get_op(img_op,platform)); 			if(img_op_value>=0&&img_op_value<=7){ 				open_img(img_op_value,platform,$(this).attr('href')); 				if ( e && e.preventDefault ) 					e.preventDefault(); 				else 					window.event.returnValue = false;  				return false; 			}     	}); 	}else{/*旧版本*/ 		function show_small_gif(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				/*console.log($(this).css('background-image'));*/ 				$(this).find('.play_btn').css("text-indent","0"); 				if($(this).attr("data-ratio") && /gif/i.test($(this).attr("type")) ){                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     $(this).css({width:"100%",height:0,"padding-top":100/ratio+"%"}).find(".play_btn").css({top:0,height:'100%'});                 } 				if($(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){                     $(this).append('<img class="img-thumb" style="position: absolute;top: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;object-fit: cover;" src="'+ $(this).attr("data-thumb") +'" />'); 					$(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}; 		show_small_gif(); 		$(".img_wrap").click(function (event) { 		    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url'); 			if(jumpUrl){ 				return openLink(jumpUrl); 			} 			if ($(this).attr('type') == 'IMG') {                 $(this).css("width", 'auto');                 $(this).css("height", 'auto');                 $(this).css("background", 'none');                 $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 event.stopPropagation();             }else{                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                     $(this).css({width:"auto",height:"auto","padding-top":0,background:"none"});                     $(this).find('.img-thumb').remove();                 }.bind(this));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));             } 		});  	    if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){             /*$(".img_wrap").click();*/             setTimeout('$(".img_wrap").click()',200); 		}else{/*旧版非gif图片3G直接载入图片*/             $(".img_wrap").each(function(i){                 if($(this).attr('type')=='IMG'){                     var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     if(ratio){                         $(this).css({                             width:'100%',                             height:0,                            'padding-top':100/ratio+'%'                         }).find(".play_btn").css({                             top:0,                             height:'100%'                         });                         img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                           $(this).css({'padding-top':'0'}).find(".play_btn").hide();                         }.bind(this));                     }else{                       $(this).css("width", 'auto');                       $(this).css("height", 'auto');                       $(this).css("background", 'none');                       $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                       $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                       img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                    }                 }             }); 		} 	}  	function get_op(img_op,platform){ 		img_op_arr = img_op.split('|'); 		if(img_op_arr.length!=4)return 5; 		switch (platform){             case 'android' :                 value = img_op_arr[0].split('_');                 break;             case 'ios' :                 value = img_op_arr[1].split('_');                 break;             case 'wap' :                 value = img_op_arr[2].split('_');                 break;             case 'pc' :                 value = img_op_arr[3].split('_');                 break;             default :                 value = [5,''];         }         return value[0]; 	}  	function get_img_op_attr(img_ele,platform){ 		if(platform=='android'){ 			if(window.zhibo8OpenImage && window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 			if(window.webkit && window.webkit.messageHandlers && window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else{ 			op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 		} 		return op_value; 	} 	 	function openLink(aHref) {         if(!aHref) return;         var aNode = document.createElement('a');         aNode.href = aHref;         aNode.click();     }  	function open_img(img_op_value,platform,src){ /*		if(!(img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4)){ 			return false; 		}*/ 		/*if(src=''||src==undefine)return;*/ 		if(img_op_value==1){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openNativeImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==2){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openImageLinkWebBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==3){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openWebViewImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==4){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openSystemWebViewBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==7){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		} 	} 	}) </script><style>.video-box{position:relative;}.video-bg{position: absolute;z-index: 8 !important;width: 100%;height: 100%;background-color: transparent;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -2.94em;margin-top:  -2.94em;width: 5.88em;height: 5.88em;background: url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/m_images/inside/outs/ic_play@2x.png) center/46px no-repeat;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;width: 100px;height: 100px;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -50px;margin-top:  -50px;}</style>
